      "id": "sol.amc-8-1985-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "There are \\(10\\) terms. The average of the first and last is \\(\\dfrac{90 + 99}{2} = 94.5.\\)\n\nSo the sum is \\(10 \\cdot 94.5 = 945.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is B .",
